{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19898","headline":"商州客舍 · 孟郊","name":"商州客舍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"商山风雪壮，游子衣裳单。\n四望失道路，百忧攒肺肝。\n日短觉易老，夜长知至寒。\n泪流潇湘弦，调苦屈宋弹。\n识声今所易，识意古所难。\n声意今讵辨，高明鉴其端。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19898.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19898","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}